ask a01_2023: joint_tax[2023], res_joint[ania, 2023], res_joint[tomek, 2023], together_joint[2023], relief[2023] law 2024-04-30 as known 2024-04-30

ask a01_without_2022: joint_tax[2022], together_joint[2022] with scenario no_cut law 2024-04-30 as known 2024-04-30

ask a01_without_2023: joint_tax[2023], together_joint[2023] with scenario no_cut law 2024-04-30 as known 2024-04-30
